    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.poster.avif?t=1753540483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.webm?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.mp4?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It changes completely how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No longer are you glued to the ground. Now you can use your surrounding to reach places that were formerly impossible to reach.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The arenas are made with parkour in mind, giving you space to use it in new and creative ways. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.poster.avif?t=1753540483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.webm?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.mp4?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Play as you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from a huge arsenal of weapons with unique abilities and play styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At your service are four weapons with many more added in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battleaxe \u2192 wrecking ball of the team with high aoe damage and high health </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dusack \u2192 super fast assassin with lots of burst damage and the ability to make an enemy player take 10% more damage from everyone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boltthrower \u2192 marksman that gets huge damage the longer the match goes and has a devastating AOE ultimate ability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dragon Mirror \u2192 high single target healing with automatic self heal</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.poster.avif?t=1753540483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.webm?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.mp4?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It changes completely how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No longer are you glued to the ground. Now you can use your surrounding to reach places that were formerly impossible to reach.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The arenas are made with parkour in mind, giving you space to use it in new and creative ways. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.poster.avif?t=1753540483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.webm?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.mp4?t=1753540483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Play as you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from a huge arsenal of weapons with unique abilities and play styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At your service are four weapons with many more added in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battleaxe \u2192 wrecking ball of the team with high aoe damage and high health </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dusack \u2192 super fast assassin with lots of burst damage and the ability to make an enemy player take 10% more damage from everyone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boltthrower \u2192 marksman that gets huge damage the longer the match goes and has a devastating AOE ultimate ability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dragon Mirror \u2192 high single target healing with automatic self heal</p>",
